        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables and values\n    advances = 1200\n    declines = 800\n    prior_19_day_ema = 150\n    prior_39_day_ema = 100\n\n    # Calculate today's EMAs and McClellan Oscillator\n    net_advances = advances - declines\n    ema_19_day = net_advances * 0.10 + prior_19_day_ema * 0.90\n    ema_39_day = net_advances * 0.05 + prior_39_day_ema * 0.95\n    answer = round(ema_19_day - ema_39_day, 2)\n\n    return answer\n```",
